'''ALLEN O'NEIL''' (アレン・オニール Aren Onīru) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = ALLEN O'NEIL
|image = E 191.png
|appearance = [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 450¢ - 1,777¢
}}

==Enemy==
Another pathetic enemy, extremely low health and damage makes this enemy seem like nothing. This enemy serves no threat to any player that comes across it. Use anything to defeat it as it will most likely die in one hit anyway. Although, be weary when you encounter him at a higher magnification as he might be able to damage your attackers with 400 range or lower. Due to this, it is advisable to use cats with more than 400 range when fighting him with in higher magnifications.

